  {"anchor": "sec-6", "desc": "<p><span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>一名被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<br> 生成一枚追踪器，瞄准 12 米内最近的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>。<br> 追踪器到达<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>或到期时引爆，<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span> 3 <span class=\"pvp\">[1.75]</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>。<br> <span class=\"note\">生成 7 [1] 枚追踪器后有 8 秒冷却。</span></p>", "hash": "668903196", "icon": "elements/stasis/icons/9912f851ba.webp", "kind": "星相", "name": "冰焰飞弹", "q": "冰焰飞弹"}
